# Security headers for every page.
# HSTS starts at 5 minutes (easy to undo) and is raised step by step later: 1 day, 1 week, then 6 months.
# No includeSubDomains and no preload yet.
# The Content-Security-Policy is REPORT-ONLY for now: the browser notes problems in its console but blocks nothing.
# Tested locally against the built site (search, theme toggle and all page types) with 0 violations. The policy
# needs 'wasm-unsafe-eval' for the search (Pagefind) and style-src-attr for the few style="" attributes in posts.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=300
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self'; style-src-attr 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
